msgstr "貨到放款託管（智能合約，模擬）"

#: data/dialogue/lina_rails.json
msgid "Escrow on delivery. You pay into a smart contract: a rule that lives on the network and holds your money. It pays the supplier when your goods arrive. Not before."
msgstr "貨到放款託管。你把錢付進一份智能合約：一條跑在網路上、替你保管錢的規則。貨到了，它才付給供應商，之前都不會。"

