#: data/dialogue/sam_intro.json
msgid "Is it reliable?"
msgstr "它可靠嗎？"

#: data/dialogue/lina_rails.json
msgid "It costs 0.6 percent, fifteen dollars minimum. If the goods never come, the contract sends your money back. Nobody has to trust anybody's promise."
msgstr "費用百分之零點六，最低十五美元。貨要是一直沒到，合約會把錢退給你。沒有人需要相信誰的承諾。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It costs a fee and about a day. Order early, so the delay does not leave your shelves empty."
msgstr "要付一筆費用，也要多等大約一天。早點下單，才不會因為延遲讓貨架空著。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It costs a little profit, but can cover payroll or rent when cash is tight."
msgstr "少賺一點，但現金緊的時候可以撐過發薪日或繳房租。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It frees your hours for other work, but the weekly wage is due whether or not a run pays. Margins are thin, so it only pays with enough runs on the board."
msgstr "你的時間可以拿去做別的事，但不管有沒有單，每週的薪水都要付。利潤很薄，外送單夠多才划算。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It is an operating cost, like rent. Build it into your prices, especially as you grow."
msgstr "它跟房租一樣是營運成本。要算進定價裡，公司越大越要注意。"

#: data/events/hotel_equipment_failure.json
msgid "It is cheaper, but the affected rooms are off sale for six days."
msgstr "比較便宜，但受影響的房間會停售六天。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It is due every month whether the van moves or not, so a van that sits idle still costs you money."
msgstr "不管貨車有沒有在跑，每個月都要繳，所以停著不動的貨車照樣花你的錢。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It is much cheaper per parcel, but the driving is your time. For a small batch, or when you are busy, a courier can still be the better deal."
msgstr "每件包裹便宜很多，但開車的時間是你的。件數少、或你很忙的時候，快遞還是可能比較划算。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It is still yours on paper, but you cannot spend it. Keep enough cash outside any single payment route to run the business while it is stuck."
msgstr "帳面上還是你的，但你不能動用。單一付款管道以外，要留夠現金，才撐得過錢被卡住的這段時間。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It moves profit between segments, not into the group. The consolidated totals cancel it out, so only real savings versus buying outside count."
msgstr "它只在分部之間移動利潤，不會增加集團利潤。合併報表會把它沖銷，只有相對外購省下的成本才算數。"

#: data/dialogue/lina_rails.json
msgid "It runs on software, and software has bugs. My contract has been audited twice. I'd still say: don't put more in it than you can live without for a week."
msgstr "它是靠軟體跑的，軟體會有漏洞。我的合約審計過兩次，我還是要說：放進去的錢，最好是你就算一週動不了也沒關係的。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It shows what your business is worth today, and why both profit and cash matter."
msgstr "它告訴你事業今天值多少，也說明為什麼獲利和現金都重要。"

#: scripts/sim/logistics.gd:447
msgid "It was late, so the pay was cut."
msgstr "這單遲到了，所以報酬被扣。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/route_game.gd:149
msgid "It works, but you drove some of it twice."
msgstr "可以送完，但有些路你開了兩遍。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/sleep_modal.gd:31
msgid "It's %s. You're not tired yet: you can sleep from 7:00 PM, or after working a shift. Waiting for something? Work a shift or tidy up the business meanwhile."
msgstr "現在是 %s。你還不累：晚上 7 點以後，或上完一個班之後才能睡。在等什麼嗎？先去上個班，或整理一下生意。"

#: data/dialogue/daniel_big_deal.json
msgid "It's a lot of lamps for a small company. Think about the cash, not the headline."
msgstr "對小公司來說燈很多。想想現金，別只看總金額。"

#: data/economy/marketplace.json
msgid "It's okay."
msgstr "還行。"

#: scripts/ui/tutorial.gd:78
msgid "It's on its way. This first delivery takes a few minutes; later ones take 1–3 days. When it arrives, the sale lands in your ShopLane balance, and ShopLane pays out to your bank every week (Company OS → Finance). Meanwhile, walk over to Bloom Coffee: you'll pick up a job there next."
msgstr "包裹上路了。第一次寄送幾分鐘就會到；之後要 1–3 天。送達後，這筆錢會進你的 ShopLane 餘額，ShopLane 每週撥款到你的銀行帳戶（Company OS → 金融）。等的時候先走去 Bloom Coffee：下一步要在那裡找份工作。"

