msgid "The buyer pays a percentage of the contract before delivery; the remainder follows the payment terms."
msgstr "買方在交貨前先付合約金額的一部分，餘款依票期支付。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The buyer pays destination duty when the parcel arrives. You do not prepay it."
msgstr "包裹送達時，買家付目的地關稅，你不先代付。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The buyer pays the invoice 30 or 60 days after delivery, not on the day they get the goods."
msgstr "買方在交貨後 30 或 60 天才付款，不是收到貨當天。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The buyer takes exchange risk and may decline or offer a lower price."
msgstr "買方承擔匯率風險，可能拒絕報價或壓低價格。"

