#: data/events/hotel_event_cancelled.json
msgid "The flash sale refills some rooms for a week. Group deposits are refunded."
msgstr "限時特賣讓部分房間在一週內重新賣出，團體訂金全數退還。"

#: data/events/customs_hold.json
msgid "The goods are back in stock. Freight remains an expense."
msgstr "商品已回到庫存，運費仍列為費用。"

#: scripts/sim/company.gd:140
msgid "The grant opens with the Green Shift."
msgstr "補助要等綠色轉型才開放。"

#: data/events/energy_tariff.json
msgid "The grid raised commercial tariffs by 25%. Hold your prices and take the margin hit, or pass the cost on to drivers."
msgstr "電網把商用電價調漲 25%。可以維持售價承受毛利衝擊，或把成本轉嫁給車主。"

#: scripts/ui/hotel_ui.gd:279
msgid "The group Campaign Mixer can run an internal hotel campaign at media cost; measured conversions lift real demand for a few days."
msgstr "集團的廣告活動配置可以用媒體成本替旅館投放內部廣告；有成效的轉換會讓真實需求提高幾天。"

#: scripts/sim/hotel.gd:103
msgid "The hotel is already at its largest size."
msgstr "旅館已經是最大規模。"

#: scripts/sim/hotel.gd:41
msgid "The hotel is already open."
msgstr "旅館已經開業。"

#: data/events/automotive_claim.json
msgid "The insurer disputes a $3,200 accident repair on one of your rental cars. Pay it yourself, fight it with a lawyer, or settle for half."
msgstr "保險公司對你一輛租賃車 $3,200 的事故維修有爭議。可自己付、請律師打官司，或半價和解。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The interest costs far less than missing payroll or rent. Repay it as soon as the money arrives."
msgstr "利息遠比發不出薪水或付不出房租便宜。錢一到就還掉。"

#: scripts/sim/energy.gd:565
msgid "The landlord asked you to come back tomorrow."
msgstr "地主請你明天再來談。"

#: scripts/ui/energy_ui.gd:35
msgid "The landlord declined. Try again tomorrow."
msgstr "地主拒絕了。明天再試。"

#: scripts/sim/living.gd:78
msgid "The landlord needs a registered company on the lease."
msgstr "房東要求用登記過的公司簽租約。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The ledger averages what you paid for the units of a product at a stock location."
msgstr "帳本依同一存放地點的商品進價，計算每件平均成本。"

#: scripts/sim/cafe.gd:127 scripts/sim/compliance.gd:95
msgid "The licence fee is %s."
msgstr "執照費是 %s。"

#: data/events/hotel_equipment_failure.json
msgid "The lift and the hot water have broken in the same week."
msgstr "電梯與熱水在同一週壞了。"

#: data/events/low_cash_warning.json
msgid "The liquidator's van is on its way."
msgstr "清倉商的貨車在路上了。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The litres you burn follow the kilometres you drive, and wear and tear add a little more on every kilometre."
msgstr "用油的公升數跟著開的公里數走，每公里的耗損還要再多算一點。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The longer it is, the earlier you must reorder, or you run out and lose sales."
msgstr "交期越長，就要越早補貨，不然缺貨就會少賣。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The monthly share of subscribers expected to leave your SaaS product. Features and support help them stay."
msgstr "每月預期離開 SaaS 產品的訂戶比例；功能與客服有助留住訂戶。"

#: scripts/sim/manufacturing.gd:267
msgid "The mould is already paid for."
msgstr "已支付模具費。"

#: autoload/scene_router.gd:82
msgid "The new game could not be started because no save slot was available."
msgstr "沒有可用的存檔欄位，無法開始新遊戲。"

#: scripts/sim/legacy_business.gd:266
msgid "The next chapter is yours"
msgstr "下一段故事，由你決定"

#: scripts/sim/legacy_business.gd:75 scripts/sim/legacy_business.gd:88
msgid "The operating response is already committed. Continue with the market review."
msgstr "策略已經執行。請繼續追蹤市場表現。"

#: data/dialogue/lina_bridge.json
msgid "The operators are tracing the funds. I never asked anyone to trust me blindly. I asked them to trust code. Code has authors, and authors make mistakes."
msgstr "營運方正在追蹤資金。我從沒要求誰盲目相信我，我要的是他們相信程式碼。程式碼有作者，作者會犯錯。"

#: data/events/rail_frozen.json
msgid "The operators say {ratio} of frozen balances will come back. The attacker took the rest."
msgstr "營運方說凍結的餘額會回來 {ratio}，其餘的被駭客拿走了。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The order you visit the stops in. The shortest round trip is rarely the order on the client's list."
msgstr "你走訪各停靠點的順序。最短的來回路線，通常不是客戶清單上的順序。"

#: data/events/hotel_event_cancelled.json
msgid "The organisers cancelled the next big city event. Group guests are leaving."
msgstr "主辦單位取消了下一場城市大型活動，團體客人要退訂。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/pack_game.gd:203
msgid "The other %d orders are packed at the same standard."
msgstr "其餘 %d 張訂單照同樣水準打包。"

#: scripts/sim/legacy_business.gd:264
msgid "The ownership record is retained. A completed prior sale pays nothing again; without a live company there is no new sale."
msgstr "保留實際股權紀錄。已完成的出售不會再次付款，沒有仍在經營的公司就不會產生新交易。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "The packing table"
msgstr "打包桌"

#: scripts/sim/automotive.gd:371
msgid "The parking lot is full."
msgstr "停車場已滿。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "The payment is stuck: talk to Lina Zhao at Nexus Bank (weekdays 10–16)"
msgstr "款項卡住了：到 Nexus 銀行找 Lina Zhao（平日 10–16 點）"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "The payment still hasn't landed."
msgstr "那筆錢還是沒到。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The permit screen lists the next missing step. Switching packaging alone is not enough without a green product on sale."
msgstr "許可畫面會列出下一個缺少的步驟；只有換包材、沒有販售綠色商品仍不符合。"

#: scripts/ui/media_ui.gd:29
msgid "The pitch lost. Review creative fit before the next proposal."
msgstr "提案未得標。下次提案前請檢查創意是否符合客群。"

#: scripts/sim/legacy_business.gd:110
msgid "The price is already at its allowed limit. Choose the other strategy or review this unavailable route."
msgstr "價格已達允許的上限或下限。請改選另一種策略，或檢討無法執行的路線。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "The price is only part of the promise."
msgstr "售價之外，還有必須履行的承諾。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The price one of your businesses charges another for goods or services inside the group."
msgstr "集團內，一個事業向另一個事業收取商品或服務的價格。"

#: data/events/hotel_slump.json
msgid "The promotion softens the dip for two weeks, then it fades."
msgstr "促銷能在兩週內減緩低迷，之後效果消退。"

#: scripts/sim/company.gd:58
msgid "The registration fee is %s."
msgstr "登記規費是 %s。"

#: scripts/sim/hotel.gd:722 scripts/sim/hotel.gd:723
msgid "The renovated %s rooms are back on sale."
msgstr "翻新完成的%s重新開賣。"

#: data/events/automotive_flood.json
msgid "The repair removes most of the damage but costs money and workshop days."
msgstr "修復能去除大部分損壞，但要花錢和工作天。"

#: data/events/hotel_review_storm.json
msgid "The review stays heavy until fresh reviews dilute it."
msgstr "這則評價會一直很有分量，直到新評價把它稀釋。"

#: data/help/help.json scripts/ui/minigames/route_game.gd:39
msgid "The river can only be crossed at a bridge. Undo takes the last stop back; the route is drawn as you go."
msgstr "過河只能走橋。「收回」會取消最後一個停靠點；路線會隨著你的點選畫出來。"

#: scripts/sim/energy.gd:119
msgid "The roof load limit allows fewer panels."
msgstr "屋頂承重上限不能放這麼多面板。"

#: data/dialogue/sam_owner.json
msgid "The runs are posted every morning. Plan the route before you turn the key: every kilometre you don't drive is money you keep."
msgstr "外送單每天早上上架。發動前先排好路線：少開的每一公里，都是你留下的錢。"

#: scripts/sim/automotive.gd:233
msgid "The sale fell through: not enough cash or lot space."
msgstr "交易失敗：現金或車場空間不足。"

#: scripts/sim/real_estate.gd:186
msgid "The sale would not cover the mortgage and the company cannot pay the shortfall. Raise cash or wait for prices to recover."
msgstr "這筆出售無法還清房貸，公司也付不起差額。請先籌措現金，或等房價回升。"

#: autoload/save_system.gd:189 autoload/save_system.gd:320
msgid "The save could not be written. Your existing save is unchanged."
msgstr "無法寫入存檔。原有存檔仍完整保留。"

#: scripts/sim/legacy_business.gd:116
msgid "The scale supplier does not carry this product. Choose niche or restock from Operations."
msgstr "規模方案的供應商沒有這項商品。請改選利基，或到營運頁向其他供應商備貨。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The seller pays destination duty before the parcel leaves. The buyer sees a complete price."
msgstr "包裹出發前，由賣家付目的地關稅，買家看到的是完整價格。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The share of payments on a payment route that landed on time. It moves when something goes wrong on the route, and recovers slowly as payments land."
msgstr "某條付款管道上，準時到帳的款項所占的比例。管道出事時會下降，之後隨著款項陸續到帳慢慢回升。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/parcel_sort_game.gd:90
msgid "The shift lead took the postcode sheet. From memory now!"
msgstr "組長把郵遞區號表收走了，現在要靠記憶！"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/route_game.gd:145
msgid "The shortest way there is. Textbook."
msgstr "這就是最短的路線，教科書等級。"

#: scripts/sim/automotive.gd:673
msgid "The showroom does not have room for that many cars."
msgstr "展示中心放不下那麼多車。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The smallest quantity a supplier will sell you in one order."
msgstr "供應商一次最少要賣給你的數量。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The stars customers give your café. They drift toward how each day felt: queues, running out, prices and service."
msgstr "客人給你的咖啡店打的星等，會慢慢反映每天的體驗：排隊、缺貨、價格和服務。"

#: data/events/energy_vandal.json
msgid "The station is back in three days."
msgstr "充電站三天後恢復營運。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The steady cost of following the rules: filings, checks and the person who keeps them in order."
msgstr "遵守規定的固定成本：申報、審查，還有負責把這些整理好的人。"

#: scripts/sim/cafe.gd:154
msgid "The storeroom can't take that much."
msgstr "儲藏室放不下這麼多。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The supplier normally deducts 15% of the original purchase value on a return. Aurelia Makers charges no cancellation or restocking fee."
msgstr "退貨通常扣除原進貨金額的 15%。Aurelia Makers 不收取消或退貨手續費。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The supplier offer estimates the share of incoming units that may be unusable. The actual receipt can differ."
msgstr "供應商報價中的瑕疵率是預估無法使用的比例，實際收貨結果可能不同。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The supplier ships sooner because a bank stands behind you. It costs a fee, but protects both sides."
msgstr "有銀行做擔保，供應商會更快出貨。要付手續費，但買賣雙方都有保障。"

#: data/events/shipment_lost.json
msgid "The supplier will ship again. Expect it {days} days late."
msgstr "供應商會重新出貨，預計晚 {days} 天到。"

#: data/dialogue/ines_customs.json
msgid "The tariff code describes the goods, not the tax you would prefer. Electronics, household goods, textiles or general goods."
msgstr "稅則描述的是商品，不是你想付的稅率。請依實際商品選電子產品、家用品、紡織品或一般商品。"

#: data/events/hotel_strike.json
msgid "The team stays and no rooms are lost."
msgstr "團隊留下來，沒有任何房間受影響。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "The teller is open weekdays 9 to 16. Loans are at the manager's desk."
msgstr "櫃台平日 9 點到 16 點營業。貸款請找經理。"

#: scripts/world/actions.gd:113
msgid "The teller window is closed."
msgstr "櫃檯窗口已關閉。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "The trial needs 10 delivered units with returns below 15%. After two weeks, it needs 5 units; reviewing and pausing expansion is an honest alternative, not a sales success."
msgstr "試銷目標是送達 10 件、退件率低於 15%。兩週後降為 5 件；檢討後暫停擴張也是替代路徑，但不算銷售成功。"

#: data/help/patch_notes.json
msgid "The tutorial recovers pending stock deliveries in older saves, keeps your day pass, and continues from the step you reached."
msgstr "舊存檔教學能補送尚未到達的貨、保留日票，並從原本的步驟繼續。"

#: data/events/rival_undercut.json
msgid "The unavailable route is recorded honestly. Maya can help you choose the next chapter."
msgstr "已如實記錄無法繼續的策略。Maya 會陪你決定下一步。"

#: scripts/ui/overseas_partner_ui.gd:45
msgid "The unhedged comparison values the starting estimated foreign receipts at today's quote versus the quote before the shock. It is not a second simulated business or guaranteed profit."
msgstr "未避險試算以期初預估外幣收入，比較目前與衝擊前匯率；並未另外模擬一家公司，也不保證獲利。"

#: scripts/sim/cafe.gd:98
msgid "The unit is already fitted out."
msgstr "店面已經裝修好了。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/route_game.gd:38
msgid "The van leaves the depot at Pier 7, calls at every stop once and comes back. Click the stops in the order you want to drive them."
msgstr "貨車從 7 號碼頭的車場出發，每個停靠點各停一次，再開回來。依照你想開的順序點選停靠點。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "The van starts at Pier 7, calls at every numbered stop once and comes back. Click the stops in the order you want to drive them."
msgstr "貨車從 7 號碼頭出發，每個編號的停靠點各停一次，再開回來。依照你想開的順序點選停靠點。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/pack_ship_modal.gd:67
msgid "The van takes %d parcels a trip: the other %d wait for the next one."
msgstr "貨車一趟載 %d 件：其餘 %d 件等下一趟。"

#: data/events/media_pr.json
msgid "The weaker creative will reduce campaign clicks."
msgstr "較差的創意將減少活動點擊。"

#: data/events/rail_frozen.json
msgid "The wire is on its way. Your stock ships when it lands; the frozen money comes back when the bridge reopens."
msgstr "電匯已經匯出。款項到了就出貨；凍結的錢等跨鏈橋重開後退回。"

#: data/dialogue/nina_first.json
msgid "Then Executive. People decide in the first four seconds. Make them count."
msgstr "那就選主管系列。別人在頭四秒就決定對你的印象，好好把握。"

#: data/dialogue/maya_legacy.json
msgid "Then choose from the actual books. Even after a closure, you can carry on. Let us look at the people, the company and the timeline together."
msgstr "那就依照現在的帳目來選吧。即使公司關了，也能繼續往前走。我們一起看看遇過的人、做過的生意，還有一路的紀錄。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "Then choose how they leave: book a courier (collects from here for a pickup fee) or carry them to PostPoint yourself."
msgstr "再選寄送方式：叫快遞（來這裡收件，收取件費），或自己拿去 PostPoint。"

#: data/dialogue/victor_offer.json
msgid "Then say yes, say no, or say a better number. I respect all three."
msgstr "然後說好、說不，或報一個更好的數字。三種我都尊重。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/barista_game.gd:10 scripts/ui/minigames/cowork_host_game.gd:7
msgid "Theo"
msgstr "Theo"

#: scripts/sim/acquisition.gd:91 scripts/sim/acquisition.gd:96
msgid "There is no offer on the table."
msgstr "目前沒有任何收購提案。"

#: autoload/scene_router.gd:171
msgid "There is no public entrance here."
msgstr "這裡沒有對外開放的入口。"

#: data/dialogue/maya_cafe.json
msgid "There you are!"
msgstr "你在這！"

#: data/dialogue/daniel_big_deal.json
msgid "There you are. Crestline's autumn range needs desk lamps."
msgstr "你來了。Crestline 的秋季系列需要檯燈。"

#: scripts/sim/insolvency.gd:64
msgid "There's no bank loan to restructure."
msgstr "沒有可以重整的銀行貸款。"

#: scripts/sim/legacy_business.gd:277
msgid "These are estimates from the current product cost and reference demand, not a second company or booked revenue. FX, duties, returns, rent and debt interest can reduce either result."
msgstr "這是依目前商品成本與參考需求估算的比較，不是另一家公司的實際營收。匯率、關稅、退貨、租金與貸款利息都可能讓結果變差。"

#: scripts/ui/overseas_partner_ui.gd:79
msgid "These use the current product price and domestic stock cost, assume all units sell, and exclude duties, refunds, packing, FX movement and other overhead. They are comparisons, not guaranteed profit. No second business was run."
msgstr "試算採目前售價與本國庫存成本，假設全數售出，未計關稅、退款、包材、匯率變動與其他開銷。僅供比較，不保證獲利，也未另外經營一家公司。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/company_os.gd:957
msgid "They agreed to your terms. Accept to sign."
msgstr "對方同意你的條件。按接受就能簽約。"

#: data/events/shipment_lost.json
msgid "They can ship it again, {days} days later than planned."
msgstr "他們可以重新出貨，比原訂晚 {days} 天。"

#: data/events/customer_return.json
msgid "They keep it. Meh review."
msgstr "商品留給對方。評價不會太好。"

#: scripts/sim/contracts.gd:124
msgid "They need an invoice from a registered company."
msgstr "對方需要登記公司開立的發票。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/company_os.gd:959
msgid "They walked away."
msgstr "對方放棄了。"

#: data/character/options.json
msgid "Thick"
msgstr "濃眉"

#: scripts/sim/ecommerce.gd:216
msgid "This %s."
msgstr "這個方式%s。"

#: scripts/sim/manufacturing.gd:107
msgid "This RFQ has expired."
msgstr "這份詢價單已到期。"

#: scripts/sim/media.gd:222
msgid "This advertising slot is unavailable or inventory is exhausted."
msgstr "此廣告時段無法出售，或庫存已耗盡。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/export_income_modal.gd:34
msgid "This allocates the conversion quote and pickup fee to this order. Stock, packing, duties and refunds still reduce profit; revenue is not cash."
msgstr "這張卡將換匯匯率與收件費分攤到本訂單。貨品、包材、關稅與退款還會降低利潤；營收不等於現金。"

#: scripts/sim/energy.gd:467
msgid "This application is already filed."
msgstr "這份申請已經送出。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "This card lists updates after the version that last saved your game. Scroll to read all release notes."
msgstr "這張卡片列出原存檔版本之後的更新，可向下捲動閱讀全部內容。"

#: scripts/sim/media.gd:79 scripts/sim/media.gd:91
msgid "This client brief expired during production."
msgstr "此客戶需求在製作期間已到期。"

#: scripts/sim/global_market.gd:310
msgid "This company's books are closed."
msgstr "這家公司已結束營業並結清帳目。"

#: scripts/sim/contracts.gd:223
msgid "This contract belongs to another company."
msgstr "這份合約屬於其他公司。"

#: scripts/sim/customs.gd:92
msgid "This customs hold is no longer active."
msgstr "這筆海關扣留已結束。"

#: scripts/sim/hotel.gd:610
msgid "This equipment needs no service today."
msgstr "這些設備今天不需要保養。"

#: scripts/ui/phone_ui.gd:362
msgid "This game autosaves to slot %d every few seconds. A new game gets its own slot; load other games from the title screen."
msgstr "這場遊戲每隔幾秒自動存到欄位 %d。新遊戲會用自己的欄位；其他存檔可以在標題畫面讀取。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/pause_menu.gd:20
msgid "This game autosaves to slot %d."
msgstr "這場遊戲自動存在欄位 %d。"

#: scripts/sim/hotel.gd:563
msgid "This group block has expired."
msgstr "這筆團體房已過期。"

#: scripts/sim/group_jobs.gd:76
msgid "This group job is no longer on offer."
msgstr "這個集團委託已不再開放。"

#: scripts/sim/group_jobs.gd:140
msgid "This group job is not running."
msgstr "這個集團委託沒有進行中。"

#: scripts/sim/fx_forward.gd:73
msgid "This hedge is not due or was already settled."
msgstr "這筆避險尚未到期，或已結算。"

#: scripts/sim/contracts.gd:91
msgid "This invoice was sold to a collector as part of the company liquidation. The buyer will not pay the closed company again."
msgstr "這張發票已隨清算賣給催收公司，買方不會再付款給已結束的公司。"

